      "created_at": "2014-04-22T02:55:01.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p><strong>Good Samaritan</strong> - At the Start of the Environment turn, the players may choose to play the top card of the villain deck.&nbsp; If they do, put this card under the safe house card.&nbsp; When this card is destroyed, Spite regains H hp.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Forced Entry</strong> - Put all cards under the safe house card into play.&nbsp; Destroy a victim card.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I had Good Samaritan out and wanted to put him in the Safe House at the beginning of the environment turn.&nbsp; I drew Forced Entry from the Villain deck.&nbsp; What is the exact sequence of how these cards would play out?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
